OL,3,GNEWSAWhen whole towns closed and headed
OL,4,Afor the seaside
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire had "Wakes Week", Midlanders
OL,7,Floved "Factory Fortnight", and Scots
OL,8,Flooked forward to "Fair Fortnight" or
OL,9,F"Miners' Fortnight".
